anch-cleanup-cookbook","content":"Record the tip SHA of every branch in that table before anything goes. A recorded SHA is\nrecoverable until garbage collection; an unrecorded one is not."},"3038":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-97","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"Verified against the remotes on 2026-11-08. Repositories move: re-run the Phase 0 inventory\nrather than trusting this table."},"3039":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-98","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"| Repository                     | Default | Environment-shaped branches                                    | Deployment mechanism | First move                                                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toxicoder/evo-t1-coder-stack` | `main`  | `dev`, `development`, `staging`, `uat`, `prod` - all `ahead=0` |                      | Confirm deletion of the five merged branches; the model is already documented |","table":"table-3"},"3040":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-99","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"| Repository                       | Default | Environment-shaped branches                                  | Deployment mechanism                                               | First move                                                                                          |\n| -------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toxicoder/nvidia-dgx-spark-lab` | `main`  | `development` (+ `dev`), `development` 134 ahead / 27 behind | `k8s/` with a `k8s/dev/` overlay, Compose for dashboard and hermes | Port the 134 commits in slices onto `main`, flag-off the unfinished ones, then retire `development` |","table":"table-3"},"3041":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-100","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"| Repository                 | Default | Environment-shaped branches                                                                                      | Deployment mechanism                                                                            | First move                                                                                                                                        |\n| -------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toxicoder/ez-comfy-stack` | `main`  | `development` (+ `dev`), `development` 523 ahead / 19 behind, plus `feat/`, `fix/`, `feature/`, `docs/` families | Compose (`docker/docker-compose.yml`), `scripts/manage.sh`, Makefile, an image-publish workflow | Port in themed slices; the published image tag is the promotion lever, so land the tag story first and normalise the `feature/` prefix to `feat/` |","table":"table-3"},"3042":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-101","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"| Repository               | Default | Environment-shaped branches                               | Deployment mechanism                           | First move                                                                          |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `toxicoder/inkorporated` | `main`  | `development` (+ `dev`), `development` 0 ahead / 2 behind | `infrastructure/`, CI plus presubmit workflows | `development` is already merged: list it for deletion, then fix the naming families |","table":"table-3"},"3043":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-102","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#per-repository-notes","content":"Two patterns worth reading across those rows. A branch family that is `ahead=0` (this repo,\n`inkorporated`) is a cleanup with no risk once a human confirms it. A branch family that is\nhundreds of commits ahead (`nvidia-dgx-spark-lab`, `ez-comfy-stack`) is a porting programme:\nslice by area, land each slice green, and let the flags hold what is not finished. Both begin\nwith the same inventory, and both end with a table a person signs off on."},"3044":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-103","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"No force-push, no rewritten shared history, no merging your own pull request."},"3045":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-104","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"No remote branch deleted without explicit confirmation, and never a trunk ref."},"3046":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-105","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"No secret in a committed file, including the flags file and per-environment value files.\nSamples hold key names and inert defaults; secrets go to the GitHub Environment or the\ncluster's secret store."},"3047":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-106","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"Keep the existing gates green and extend what exists. No new CI system, no Kubernetes, no\nflag platform, no new dependency."},"3048":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-107","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"One logical change per branch and per pull request, with docs and tests in the same change."},"3049":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-108","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#safety-lines","content":"A default-branch rename is its own confirmed step, done after the content has converged,\nbecause GitHub rewrites links, protections and open pull requests when it happens."},"3050":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-109","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#running-it","content":"The skill is `skills/trunk-refactor/SKILL.md`. A session in this repository reaches it through\n`AGENTS.md`; any other repository gets it by installing it into the two skill homes the agents\nread:"},"3051":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-110","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#running-it","content":"Then, in a new session in the repository you want to convert:"},"3052":{"id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor-111","page_id":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor","tags":["git","branching","ci","feature-flags","environments","refactor"],"type":"text","url":"/workflows/trunk-feature-flags-refactor#running-it","content":"Discovery reloads from disk, so the copy above needs a new turn before the slash command\nappears. The run ends with the report the skill specifies: summary, criteria table, branch\ndecisions, environment mapping, flags introduced, promotion commands, deletions pending\nconfirmation, and next manual steps."}},"count":3052},"sorting":{"language":"multilingual","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":1270,"2":2801,"3":1271,"4":1785,"5":3033,"6":1388,"7":1696,"8":1361,"9":2