te/secrets.md |"],[2088,"| Symptom or task                                    | Page               |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| A workspace is stuck, or its editor will not start | coder-templates.md |"],[2089,"| Symptom or task                                   | Page             |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| A public name does not resolve or redirects wrong | public-access.md |"],[2085,"| Symptom or task                               | Page               |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| Something fails, and you have an error string | troubleshooting.md |"],[2084,"| Symptom or task                               | Page         |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| A card is red, or the dashboard will not load | dashboard.md |"],[2094,"| Symptom or task                         | Page                |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| A Spark is not showing up in Prometheus | spark-monitoring.md |"],[2087,"| Symptom or task                         | Page               |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| A model answered from the wrong backend | litellm-routing.md |"],[2086,"| Symptom or task                         | Page              |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| A `git pull` landed and the ports moved | config-updates.md |"],[2091,"| Symptom or task                | Page      |\n| ------------------------------ | --------- |\n| The assistant will not sign in | hermes.md |"],[630,"| Target                    | What it runs                                                                                   |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `//scripts:test-in-image` | The merge gate inside